{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"We must make every effort to root out that meddlesome cult.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:14:05.587000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737870539493998640","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"I only want to make sure you will be able to 'hit the ground running' as the children say\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:14:40.301000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737870685094805534","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"Captain, for your implications on who should be mayor, I simply don't lust for that kind of power. Are you sure someone like me would *should* even be mayor?\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:15:11.096000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-29T03:15:20.128000Z","id":"737870814258528366","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"Once we hit land, we will need to begin work immediately.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:15:19.702000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737870850354839593","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"If your constitution is not up to the task, there is no shame in that. I only ask that you spread the word among the other nobility as to the serious nature of what is to come.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:16:15.107000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737871082740121601","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"Who... who would you choose for the position?\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:16:34.077000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737871162305937440","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"As an agent of the king, I may throw my support behind someone, but for now I am still taking their measure.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:17:28.536000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737871390723801130","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"I only ask that you get with the other nobles and talk it through. We need people of class and sophistication if we ever hope to succeed.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:18:07.194000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737871552866943097","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"He nods, thoughtfully","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:18:16.967000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737871593858007054","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
